    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heart of a Bird in a Cage is a short visual novel presented in roughly 880 words of text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It sheds light on the story between Sa the mountain guardian and Alice the bird spirit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features 20 sets of vivid artwork, a sweet female voice and soft and sentimental musical compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tale intertwining warmth, bitterness, longing and compromise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen closely to bird spirit Alice's story of life.</p>",
